following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"milestoned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-05-18T12:02:50Z","milestone":{"title":"v0.29.0"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"f2ac2e4f271a2754da199673f43f9250f15f05ac","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKGYyYWMyZTRmMjcxYTI3NTRkYTE5OTY3M2Y0M2Y5MjUwZjE1ZjA1YWM","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/f2ac2e4f271a2754da199673f43f9250f15f05ac","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/f2ac2e4f271a2754da199673f43f9250f15f05ac","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T09:21:32Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T15:05:01Z"},"tree":{"sha":"b79067696dc348dd9608034c9bbe30f0e4047b24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/b79067696dc348dd9608034c9bbe30f0e4047b24"},"message":"hscontrol: gate proxy header trust on trusted_proxies\n\nchi middleware.RealIP was mounted unconditionally on both the\npublic router and the noise router, so any client could send\nX-Real-IP or X-Forwarded-For and have the spoofed value land in\nr.RemoteAddr and the access-log remote= field.\n\nAdd a top-level trusted_proxies config option (list of CIDRs) and\nreplace middleware.RealIP with a gated middleware that:\n\n  - honours True-Client-IP / X-Real-IP / X-Forwarded-For only when\n    r.RemoteAddr is inside one of the configured prefixes;\n  - strips those three headers from every request whose peer is\n    not trusted, so downstream handlers cannot read them.\n\nX-Forwarded-For is parsed via realclientip-go's\nRightmostTrustedRangeStrategy so a prepended value cannot win in a\nproxy chain. trustedProxies() rejects 0.0.0.0/0 and ::/0 at config\nload.\n\nEmpty trusted_proxies (the default) skips the mount entirely;\nr.RemoteAddr is the directly-connecting TCP peer.","parents":[{"sha":"6c4752720329a2e87aca9dc159a21f11f3fe6560","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/6c4752720329a2e87aca9dc159a21f11f3fe6560","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/6c4752720329a2e87aca9dc159a21f11f3fe6560"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"4cdd9a0858e049bd3f9cf341d966122f872a84ce","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDRjZGQ5YTA4NThlMDQ5YmQzZjljZjM0MWQ5NjYxMjJmODcyYTg0Y2U","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/4cdd9a0858e049bd3f9cf341d966122f872a84ce","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/4cdd9a0858e049bd3f9cf341d966122f872a84ce","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T09:22:52Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-18T15:05:01Z"},"tree":{"sha":"f1a0181f6273dd51caaddd66622b39afb103c55d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/f1a0181f6273dd51caaddd66622b39afb103c55d"},"message":"docs: document trusted_proxies config option\n\nCover the option in config-example.yaml, the reverse-proxy\nintegration guide, and the 0.29.0 CHANGELOG.","parents":[{"sha":"f2ac2e4f271a2754da199673f43f9250f15f05ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/f2ac2e4f271a2754da199673f43f9250f15f05ac","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/f2ac2e4f271a2754da199673f43f9250f15f05ac"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"re